 "footer": "Sources: CRA T4127 (2026) \u00b7 Manitoba 2026 rates \u00b7 Federal Annual Financial Report 2024-25 \u00b7 Manitoba Public Accounts 2025-26 \u00b7 General info, not advice",
 "data": {
